TITLE Equilibration with mineral assemblage
SOLUTION 1
    temp      100
    pH        5
    units     mmol/kgw
    Ba        100
    water     1
EQUILIBRIUM_PHASES 1
    Talc           0 10
    Rhodochrosite  0 10
    Sepiolite      0 10
    Sepiolite(d)   0 10
    Pb(OH)2        0 10
SELECTED_OUTPUT
    -file selected.out
    -reset false
USER_PUNCH
    -headings Talc_final
10 PUNCH EQUI("Talc")
END
